Graph relationships and code quality analysis

Usage:
  eshu analyze [command]

Available Commands:
  callers     Show what calls a function
  calls       Show what a function calls
  chain       Show call chain between two functions
  complexity  Show function complexity
  dead-code   Find potentially unused functions and classes
  deps        Show import and dependency relationships
  divergence  Find parallel function implementations
  overrides   Find implementations across classes
  tree        Show inheritance hierarchy
  variable    Show variable definitions and usage

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for analyze

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu analyze [command] --help" for more information about a command.
